    {
      "id": "imported_2425_a899d14a5a68",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Into my heart an air that kills from yon",
      "content": "Into my heart an air that kills from yon,<br>Far country blows: what are those blue<br>remembered hills, what farms, what spires<br>are those ? that is the land of lost content, I<br>see it shining plain, the happy highway where<br>i went and cannot go again...",
      "plainText": "Into my heart an air that kills from yon,\nFar country blows: what are those blue\nremembered hills, what farms, what spires\nare those ? that is the land of lost content, I\nsee it shining plain, the happy highway where\ni went and cannot go again...",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-10-29T18:40:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-10-29T18:40:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_dd3bca5dcc6b",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "It's not just me is it..???",
      "content": "It's not just me is it..???<br>You felt too, didn't you? The tension, the<br>electricity, the thickness of the air between<br>us..<br>It's so awkward, isn't it? I miss the feeling,<br>though, It's addictive..<br>I hope you are doing well, i miss you<br>everytime, everywhere and in everything<br>whether if it's day, noon, evening or night..",
      "plainText": "It's not just me is it..???\nYou felt too, didn't you? The tension, the\nelectricity, the thickness of the air between\nus..\nIt's so awkward, isn't it? I miss the feeling,\nthough, It's addictive..\nI hope you are doing well, i miss you\neverytime, everywhere and in everything\nwhether if it's day, noon, evening or night..",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-10-28T23:15:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-10-28T23:15:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_37e44144b9f1",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Maybe one day we will get married",
      "content": "21:31 25th Oct 25<br>Maybe one day we will get married... we will<br>have children, if they look like me then they<br>will be poets, or if they look like you then they<br>will be poems",
      "plainText": "21:31 25th Oct 25\nMaybe one day we will get married... we will\nhave children, if they look like me then they\nwill be poets, or if they look like you then they\nwill be poems",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-10-25T21:31:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-10-25T21:31:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_51ccc9cdb931",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Selfishness",
      "content": "Selfishness<br>I hope the war doesn't start today, there is a<br>coffee shop I need to take a friend i have<br>known for too long to, where they sell the<br>best sandwiches, this side of the river hope<br>they wait till Tuesday or tomorrow, at least if<br>there's is a singular god furious at our selfish<br>squabbling and he sent these bombs in the<br>post may the postman go on strike so I can<br>tell my lover I love her, so child can eat, so my<br>mother can dance one more, my father can<br>decide he loves me but if war starts today, a<br>part of me won't be opposed, as the<br>billionaire burns with his Pinocchio nose, the<br>kindling of this fire started long before, bcz<br>the flames kiss the rich, they have already<br>swallowed the poor",
      "plainText": "Selfishness\nI hope the war doesn't start today, there is a\ncoffee shop I need to take a friend i have\nknown for too long to, where they sell the\nbest sandwiches, this side of the river hope\nthey wait till Tuesday or tomorrow, at least if\nthere's is a singular god furious at our selfish\nsquabbling and he sent these bombs in the\npost may the postman go on strike so I can\ntell my lover I love her, so child can eat, so my\nmother can dance one more, my father can\ndecide he loves me but if war starts today, a\npart of me won't be opposed, as the\nbillionaire burns with his Pinocchio nose, the\nkindling of this fire started long before, bcz\nthe flames kiss the rich, they have already\nswallowed the poor",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-10-15T14:20:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-10-15T14:20:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_65ed81266a49",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Call me when ur heart remembers...",
      "content": "Call me when ur heart<br>remembers...<br>\"Ah\" said the cat,<br>How I wish to be independent, live alone,<br>and not grieve for everyone<br>\"Well now\" said the tree with dignity,<br>It's not too hard to learn..",
      "plainText": "Call me when ur heart\nremembers...\n\"Ah\" said the cat,\nHow I wish to be independent, live alone,\nand not grieve for everyone\n\"Well now\" said the tree with dignity,\nIt's not too hard to learn..",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-10-03T20:30:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-10-03T20:30:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_59a0ec55fa66",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "A word is dead",
      "content": "A word is dead<br>Your voice, your eyes, your hands, your lips,<br>our silence, our words,<br>Light that fades away, light that comes back<br>One smile for the two of us...",
      "plainText": "A word is dead\nYour voice, your eyes, your hands, your lips,\nour silence, our words,\nLight that fades away, light that comes back\nOne smile for the two of us...",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-09-16T22:45:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-09-16T22:45:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_17efd20d7765",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Wish to die..",
      "content": "wish to die..<br>Is there really any value to this thing we<br>called \"living\"<br>I added your city to my clock so that I'd know<br>when to call, i checked the time wanting to<br>hear your voice it was 2 in the middle of night",
      "plainText": "wish to die..\nIs there really any value to this thing we\ncalled \"living\"\nI added your city to my clock so that I'd know\nwhen to call, i checked the time wanting to\nhear your voice it was 2 in the middle of night",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-08-29T02:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-08-29T02:00:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_e432483f4613",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "So tired of everything",
      "content": "So tired of everything<br>I wana go somewhere far away, somewhere<br>there is no job, no people, where nobody<br>expects anything from me, place where i<br>could be free..",
      "plainText": "So tired of everything\nI wana go somewhere far away, somewhere\nthere is no job, no people, where nobody\nexpects anything from me, place where i\ncould be free..",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-08-05T19:05:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-08-05T19:05:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_5f8048eed41b",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Not really doing well",
      "content": "recently, I've been noticing that I'm not really<br>doing well. i wasn't better, i just kept<br>distracting myself so i wouldn't have to deal<br>with how i really feel<br>self-sabotage is weird like, what do you mean<br>i make myself miserable? and I'm aware of it?<br>and i don't even know how to stop???",
      "plainText": "recently, I've been noticing that I'm not really\ndoing well. i wasn't better, i just kept\ndistracting myself so i wouldn't have to deal\nwith how i really feel\nself-sabotage is weird like, what do you mean\ni make myself miserable? and I'm aware of it?\nand i don't even know how to stop???",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-07-18T02:15:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-07-18T02:15:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_7d477ba57290",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "All I need is someone who hates the crowd",
      "content": "All i need is someone who hates the crowd as<br>much as i do, so we could just spend our whole<br>life in a quiet place without other humans...<br>Between ten people, nine would swim oceans<br>for you<br>But you'll drown chasing the one who won't<br>even step in the water.",
      "plainText": "All i need is someone who hates the crowd as\nmuch as i do, so we could just spend our whole\nlife in a quiet place without other humans...\nBetween ten people, nine would swim oceans\nfor you\nBut you'll drown chasing the one who won't\neven step in the water.",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-06-29T17:50:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-06-29T17:50:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_56fd7fee09e1",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Corpse Bride vows",
      "content": "If I ever get married, i want to<br>do the vows from \"corpse bride\"<br>\"With this hand<br>Your cup will never be empty,<br>With this candle,<br>With this ring,<br>I ask you to be mine.\"",
      "plainText": "If I ever get married, i want to\ndo the vows from \"corpse bride\"\n\"With this hand\nYour cup will never be empty,\nWith this candle,\nWith this ring,\nI ask you to be mine.\"",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-06-04T23:15:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-06-04T23:15:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_6d31a33b1c87",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "I remembered the day I realised you were different",
      "content": "I remember the day i realised you were<br>different, that you were like me in some way i<br>can't quite identify, it felt like we recognised<br>something in each other in that moment, A<br>playful, combative spirit maybe. That familiar,<br>mischievous sparkle in your eye like I had<br>finally met one of my kind...<br>You are remarkably strong-willed and sure of<br>yourself, so confident and comfortable in<br>your own skin, i find that inspiring still now,<br>you were magical like my life changed, it was<br>different from any other thing..",
      "plainText": "I remember the day i realised you were\ndifferent, that you were like me in some way i\ncan't quite identify, it felt like we recognised\nsomething in each other in that moment, A\nplayful, combative spirit maybe. That familiar,\nmischievous sparkle in your eye like I had\nfinally met one of my kind...\nYou are remarkably strong-willed and sure of\nyourself, so confident and comfortable in\nyour own skin, i find that inspiring still now,\nyou were magical like my life changed, it was\ndifferent from any other thing..",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-05-09T21:40:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-05-09T21:40:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_2e4698357c37",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Maybe it was your laugh",
      "content": "Maybe it was your laugh, or your eyes, or<br>your smile. Maybe it was your hair, or voice,<br>personality, or watching you talk. But<br>whatever it was, it made me fall pretty damn<br>hard.",
      "plainText": "Maybe it was your laugh, or your eyes, or\nyour smile. Maybe it was your hair, or voice,\npersonality, or watching you talk. But\nwhatever it was, it made me fall pretty damn\nhard.",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-04-14T22:10:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-04-14T22:10:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_b58026aa9d73",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "The girl in red",
      "content": "The girl in red<br>I'm really quite good at forgetting things,<br>especially when they important to me<br>I heard ur name in the middle of my prayer<br>and i forgot who i was talking to.... you. God.<br>Both?? And guess what i don't even believe in<br>god<br>At last the Spark eventually dies<br>done chasing the ball",
      "plainText": "The girl in red\nI'm really quite good at forgetting things,\nespecially when they important to me\nI heard ur name in the middle of my prayer\nand i forgot who i was talking to.... you. God.\nBoth?? And guess what i don't even believe in\ngod\nAt last the Spark eventually dies\ndone chasing the ball",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2025-03-12T19:30:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-03-12T19:30:00.000Z"
    },
