    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_f6c8ae4c1698",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "Sawera hone par Phela khyal ho tum",
      "content": "Sawera hone par Phela khyal ho tum<br>dophere mein jo khud se puchta hu, wo pyara<br>sawal ho tum.<br>Sham dhalte-dhalte mein tumhari yadoo<br>mein, kho sa jatta hun<br>Aur raat ke sapno mein tumhara ho jata hu.<br>Aur dua karta hu<br>Jishe sirf mein pad saku wo kitab ban jao<br>Jo sirf mujhe ae wo khwab ban jao<br>Jispe sirf Mera adhikar ho wo gulab ban jao<br>Mehfil mein baat kar saku wo baat ban jao<br>Jo sirf mere sang gujre wo raat ban jao<br>Aur Jo sirf mujhe chadhe wo jamh ban jao<br>Ek khwaish hai ki<br>Mere Chote se dil ke mehman ban jao<br>Jishe zindagi bhar karu wo kaam ban jao<br>Sach kahu, tho meri jaan ban jao!",
      "plainText": "Sawera hone par Phela khyal ho tum\ndophere mein jo khud se puchta hu, wo pyara\nsawal ho tum.\nSham dhalte-dhalte mein tumhari yadoo\nmein, kho sa jatta hun\nAur raat ke sapno mein tumhara ho jata hu.\nAur dua karta hu\nJishe sirf mein pad saku wo kitab ban jao\nJo sirf mujhe ae wo khwab ban jao\nJispe sirf Mera adhikar ho wo gulab ban jao\nMehfil mein baat kar saku wo baat ban jao\nJo sirf mere sang gujre wo raat ban jao\nAur Jo sirf mujhe chadhe wo jamh ban jao\nEk khwaish hai ki\nMere Chote se dil ke mehman ban jao\nJishe zindagi bhar karu wo kaam ban jao\nSach kahu, tho meri jaan ban jao!",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2024-10-14T21:15:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2024-10-14T21:15:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_2f16cda45d30",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "It's almost october again",
      "content": "It's almost october again and the nights are<br>turning cold again..<br>But last October, everything had<br>a different meaning",
      "plainText": "It's almost october again and the nights are\nturning cold again..\nBut last October, everything had\na different meaning",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2024-09-28T22:30:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2024-09-28T22:30:00.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "imported_2425_9275210814a9",
      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "4:01 Am, Monday 1st of September 2024",
      "content": "4:01 Am, Monday 1st of September 2024<br>Today I went on train by myself for the first<br>time it was not normal coz generally no like<br>always 100% of the time I had travelled only<br>with my father, mother and family this time<br>the number went from 100% to 99%, today I<br>saw tears again but it was not mine again<br>they were my parents and grandparents well<br>that's it for now :\")",
      "plainText": "4:01 Am, Monday 1st of September 2024\nToday I went on train by myself for the first\ntime it was not normal coz generally no like\nalways 100% of the time I had travelled only\nwith my father, mother and family this time\nthe number went from 100% to 99%, today I\nsaw tears again but it was not mine again\nthey were my parents and grandparents well\nthat's it for now :\")",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2024-09-01T04:01:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2024-09-01T04:01:00.000Z"
    },
    {
