      "folderId": "notes",
      "title": "20:17, 22nd August",
      "content": "20:17, 22nd August..<br>I love being in love with you,<br>It makes even unhappiness no bigger than a<br>pin, even at time I wished so violently that i<br>could give My heart to science and be rid of<br>it",
      "plainText": "20:17, 22nd August..\nI love being in love with you,\nIt makes even unhappiness no bigger than a\npin, even at time I wished so violently that i\ncould give My heart to science and be rid of\nit",
      "pinned": false,
      "deleted": false,
      "createdAt": "2024-08-22T20:17:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": "2024-08-22T20:17:00.000Z"
