      "title": "I don't want to go to college",
      "content": "I don't want to go to college but I also don't<br>want to NOT go to college<br>What I really want is to stop existing but i<br>can't do that without dying and I don't want<br>to die either",
      "plainText": "I don't want to go to college but I also don't\nwant to NOT go to college\nWhat I really want is to stop existing but i\ncan't do that without dying and I don't want\nto die either",
